    "instructions_to_main_agent": [
        "Ensure all interactive components (buttons, search bars, modal triggers, form fields, persona switches) have unambiguous data-testid attributes formatted as kebab-case.",
        "Do NOT use transparent backgrounds on dropdown menus, modals, or fixed navigation bars. Always specify solid or crisp glass backdrop (e.g., bg-[#0A192F]/95 backdrop-blur-md).",
        "Strictly follow the user's color selection: Deep navy blue (#0A192F) for header & navigation trust, Teal (#0D9488) / Emerald (#10B981) for positive eligibility, Amber (#F59E0B) for pending tasks, Light Gray/Warm White (#FAFAFA) for background.",
        "Integrate the language switcher prominently in the header with options: English, Kannada (ಕನ್ನಡ), and Hindi (हिंदी).",
        "Ensure the Benefits Discovery Simulator runs within 2 minutes with interactive progress triggers, clear breakdown, document checklist export, and immediate state sync."
    ],
